<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN WOMEN'S OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN WOMEN'S OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results of  the</p>
<p>$926,000 German Open women's tournament on Monday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>14-Judith Wiesner (Austria) beat Laurence Courtois (Belgium)</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>15-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Natalia Zvereva (Belarus)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 6-2</p>
<p>Maria Sanchez Lorenzo (Spain) beat Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-2 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>Chanda Rubin (U.S.) beat Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Gloria Pizzichini (Italy) beat Paola Suarez (Argentina) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 4-6 6-1</p>
<p>Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Yelena Makarova (Russia) 6-2</p>
<p>7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Magui Serna (Spain) beat Tatyana Panova (Russia) 6-2 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>10-Mary-Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Flora Perfetti (Italy) 6-4 3-6 6-1  </p>
<p>Larisa Neiland (Latvia) beat Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Andrea Glass (Germany)  6-7</p>
<p>(4-7) 6-1 6-1.</p>
</text>
